{
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.a01.title": "上楼 → 空墓隧道",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail": "你继续向地下深入。脚下碎石嘎吱作响，黑暗中有水滴落……前方某处，有什么在蹒跚而行。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-11": "尚未喝过水潭的水\n已喝过水潭的水",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-2": "在（12, -35）队伍踩踏",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-3": "你的脚绊到一条横在隧道里的细线。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-4": "在（13, -35）队伍踩踏",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-5": "队伍没有盗贼\n队伍有盗贼",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-6": "横在隧道里的绊线触发，一声脆响划破黑暗。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-7": "在（13, -35）敌人踩踏",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-8": "洞窟深处，你发现一座小水池，里面盛满不自然的蓝色 液体。水面完全静止，不反射任何光。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.detail-9": "与洞窟水潭互动（19, -28）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue": "事件开场（队伍没有盗贼）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-10": "事件开场（尚未喝过水潭的水）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-11": "洞窟深处，你发现一座小水池，里面盛满不自然的蓝色液体。水面完全静止，不反射任何光。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-12": "喝池水。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-13": "「让我检查一下这物质……」（队伍有渡鸦、仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-14": "「让我试试它摸起来什么感觉。」（队伍有蛞蝓人、仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-15": "「检查水中的魔法痕迹。」（队伍有法师、仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-16": "「检查动物足迹。」（队伍有游侠、仅可选一次）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-17": "事件开场（已喝过水潭的水）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-18": "池水平静无色。曾在此徘徊的魔法已经消退。你只看见自己的倒影，别无他物。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-19": "选择「「检查动物足迹。」」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-2": "啪！机关触发，一声脆响回荡开来。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-20": "你搜索水池周围的泥地。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-21": "没有足迹。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-22": "「没有东西喝这个。」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-23": "选择「「让我检查一下这物质……」」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-24": "你蹲在池边，研究那奇怪的蓝色液体。某种感觉让你觉得熟悉。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-25": "你感应到水中不稳定的魔法。无论它对活物血肉有什么作用，对你也许不同。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-26": "「变异之水。不稳定，是的。对大多数人大概很危险。」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-27": "「但对我不是。」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-28": "选择「「检查水中的魔法痕迹。」」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-29": "你专注于静止的水面，在指间引出细小的火花。能量以嗡鸣回应。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-3": "有什么东西砸中队伍，把你撞得失去平衡。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-30": "「古老的转化残渣，」你说。「非常不可预测。」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-31": "选择「「让我试试它摸起来什么感觉。」」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-32": "你把一根手指浸入池中。蓝色液体黏在皮肤上。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-33": "一阵低沉的震动穿过你的身体。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-34": "「感觉是活的……」你低语。「……而且被腐化了。」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-35": "选择「喝池水。」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-36": "谁要喝池水？",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-4": "事件开场（队伍有盗贼）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-5": "你注意到一条细线低低地横在隧道里，黑暗中几乎看不见。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-6": "「绊线。小心，别踩上去。」",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-7": "陷阱已解除。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-8": "机关砸向那些尸体。它们踉跄了一下，却继续前进。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.dialogue-9": "陷阱如今断裂地挂着，力量已经耗尽。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.l01.detail": "0%（首次翻找）",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.l04.detail": "回气腰带、眼镜蛇、闪电箭戒指",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.l04.detail.item-links": "[[0,4,\"item_belt_of_second_wind\"],[5,8,\"item_cobra_shortsword\"],[9,14,\"item_ring_of_lightning_bolt\"]]",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.m01.detail": "队伍、物品",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.n01.detail": "从来源地坑落下后会抵达这一格。",
  "maps.points.abandoned_mines_cave.n01.detail-2": "空墓隧道 (27, -28)",
